  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Coding of speech at 16 kbit/s using low-delay code excited linear prediction</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Coding of speech at 16 kbit/s using low-delay code excited linear prediction</title>
